@startuml
actor "User" as User
participant "Frontend\n(React)" as UI
participant "FastAPI\n(REST Backend)" as API
participant "Redis\n(In-memory Cache)" as Cache
participant "PostgreSQL\n(Database)" as DB

User -> UI : Submits movie rating
activate UI

UI -> API : POST /api/ratings (JSON)
activate API

API -> Cache : Check authorization (User sessions & tokens)
activate Cache
Cache --> API : Session valid (User ID)
deactivate Cache

API -> API : Process business logic (Business logic)

API -> DB : Save rating (Ratings: user_id, movie_id, rating)
activate DB
DB --> API : Record confirmed
deactivate DB

API -> Cache : Update movie cache (Temporary data)
activate Cache
Cache --> API : Cache updated
deactivate Cache

API --> UI : 201 Created (Success)
deactivate API

UI --> User : Display updated rating (Fast, responsive user experience)
deactivate UI
@enduml
